{"question_id":"1lgvrb5w2","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2023 (Online) 10th April Evening Shift","year":2023,"subject":"physics","chapter":"heat-and-thermodynamics","chapterGroup":"mechanics","type":"mcq","marks":4,"negMarks":1,"content":"<p>A gas mixture consists of 2 moles of oxygen and 4 moles of neon at temperature T. Neglecting all vibrational modes, the total internal energy of the system will be,</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"4RT"},{"identifier":"B","content":"16RT"},{"identifier":"C","content":"8RT"},{"identifier":"D","content":"11RT"}],"correct_options":["D"],"explanation":"<p>The internal energy (U) of a gas depends on its degrees of freedom (f). <br><br>For a monatomic gas like neon, the degrees of freedom are f = 3 (translational). For a diatomic gas like oxygen, the degrees of freedom are f = 5 (3 translational + 2 rotational).</p>\n<p>The internal energy for each component of the gas mixture can be calculated using the formula:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11.325ex\" height=\"3.006ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -983.5 5005.5 1328.5\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D448\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D448\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1044.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2100.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(220,485) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(237.7,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"588.9\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2929.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3529.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D445\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D445\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(4288.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D447\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D447\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>where n is the number of moles, R is the universal gas constant, and T is the temperature.</p>\n<p>For the 4 moles of neon (monatomic):</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22.304ex\" height=\"2.736ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864.2 9858.5 1209.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D448\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D448\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(716,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(888,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D452\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D452\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2001.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(3057,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"553.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4072.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"22C5\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-22C5\"></use></g>